        <p>COUNTY H. BOROUG OF WARRINGTON TO TERRAZZO CONTRACTORS.. The Town Hall Parks and Baths Committee of the Council of the County Borough of Warrington is pre- pared to receive TENDERS for TERRAZZO WORK. Specifications, forms of Tender, bills of quantities, and all further information may be obtained at the office of the Borough Surveyor, Town Hall, on and after Wednesday next, the 15th inst., at which place tenders must be delivered before 12 o'clock noon on Thursday, the 23rd day of January next. The lowest or any tender not necessarily accepted. ANDREW M. KER.</p>
        <p>Borough EWneer and Surveyor. Borough Engineer and Surveyor's Office. 10th January, 1 913.</p>
