      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-01-11_WidnesExaminer_art0034" n="art0034">
        <head>NO CHANGE FOR 4 YEARS. Warrington Incident.</head>
        <p>NO CHANGE FOR 4 YEARS. Warrington Incident.</p>
        <p>For years the Warringion opinion repeated here has remained unchanged. Indeed, a four years' test has served but to render it more full of encourage- ment than ever.</p>
        <p>Mr, J. Ilrice lives at 46, Queen-street, Warrington, He says :—" Four years ago I had an awful attack of lumbago. I got up one morning in terrible pain-1 could scarcely get out of bed and dress myself, and the effort to get to work caused me to perspire, such agony was I in. The work I was on was not heavy, but it took me half-an-hour to do what I should have done in five minutes; the torture was almost unbear- able. The overseer asked what was wrong with me, and when I told him he said I was not to work in that state. Then I set out for home, but how I reached there I do not know, and the perspiration fairly rolled off .</p>
        <p>'My arms were all right the shoulders, too, but I had no use in the lower part [of my body. my legs being ipowerless. The kidney excre- itions were unnatural, and icalded. I got about with two sticks, and a neighbour seeing le and asking what was the latter, said If you do as I 41 you, you'll get cif those tticks in a very short time' ;</p>
        <p>her advice was to try Doan's Backache Kidney Pills, so my son went for a box. I had not taken many doses of these before I could do without the sticks, and within a week I started work again. _ -</p>
        <p>"Since then I've never been without Doan's pills and I've never had any trouble with my back. I take the pills at intervals, as it is well to be careful, and I do not want a time like that to occur again. I have advised many to try Doans's Backache Kidney Pills it is one of the pleasantest things I can do. (Signed) Joseph Price." Nearly 4 years later, Mr. Price said :—" I am pleased to say I hava never had any return of the paius since I used Doan's pills ; I take a small dose of the medicine now and again. I shall always praise it." Price 2/9 a box, 6 boxes 13/9 of all dealers, or from Poster-McClellan ,Co. 8, TV ells at., Oxf ord-st.,London W. Don't ask for backache and kidney pills—ask DISTINCTLY for DOAN'S Backache Kidney Pills, the same as Mr. Price had.</p>
        <p>. me. an , 44...... ..rrn, C;134, . p) ~... . :), , / • 8, MR J. PRICE From a P -hoto f</p>
      </div>
