        <p>St, John's Presbyterian Guild.</p>
        <p>The second portion of the winter cession was opened with a social evening and book wir y last Monday. There was a good gathering of meran-rs and friends and A most enjoyable evening was spent ir) solving the ingenious badges worn to represent well-known books, aril taking part in the games, S:c , that completed the programme.</p>
